        "TileImage": "$($repository 841ee310-e45d-4f57-b5bf-c44f0e5d9040).Image",
        "Description": "LFC #22\rKill Order: 11.19.2000\r\rA Danish based Software company has had an NDA breach. Software tester Mads S. Jorgensen is selling an illegal Alpha version of the software to a Dutch Software developer; who goes by the codename &quot;Ampburner&quot;. A Middleman who uses the alias &quot;Rocco&quot; is taking care of the money transfer.\r\rStop the trade by any means necessary - This software is of high importance.\r\rGood Luck 47\r\r- Diana.\r\rThis contract was created by a member of the HITMAN community known as Mads47",
